/* Errors and confirmations */
"The iSCSI daemon is not running." = "iSCSI 守护进程未运行。";
"The resource is in use." = "资源正在使用中。";
"The item exists already." = "该项目已存在。";
"The name is not a valid IQN or EUI-64 identifier." = "该名称不是有效的 IQN 或 EUI-64 标识符。";
"The address is not valid." = "地址无效。";
"The server did not respond in time." = "服务器未在规定时间内响应。";
"The server refused the connection. Check the address and port, and that the iSCSI service is enabled on the server." = "服务器拒绝了连接。请检查地址和端口，并确认服务器已启用 iSCSI 服务。";
